  "task": {
    "objective": "Trackers 0 and 1 cooperate to tag runners before extraction. Runners 2 and 3 cooperate to reach either exit, using hiding, shared-trail erasure and decoys with finite charges.",
    "natural_termination": "Both runners have resolved, each either captured or extracted; mixed outcomes are valid. Otherwise truncate at 64 steps. Capture precedes extraction on the same transition.",
